{"content_text": "{\"protocolSection\":{\"identificationModule\":{\"nctId\":\"NCT06799546\",\"orgStudyIdInfo\":{\"id\":\"HSK39297-301\"},\"organization\":{\"fullName\":\"Haisco Pharmaceutical Group Co., Ltd.\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"},\"briefTitle\":\"A Phase III Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of HSK39297 in Patients With Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria Who Are Naive to Complement Inhibitor Therapy\",\"officialTitle\":\"A Phase III, Multicenter, Randomized, Open Label, Active-Controlled Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of HSK39297 Tablets in Patients With Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria (PNH) Who Are Naive to Complement Inhibitor Therapy\"},\"statusModule\":{\"statusVerifiedDate\":\"2025-12\",\"overallStatus\":\"COMPLETED\",\"expandedAccessInfo\":{\"hasExpandedAccess\":false},\"startDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2025-02-13\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"primaryCompletionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2025-11-05\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"completionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2025-11-05\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"studyFirstSubmitDate\":\"2025-01-23\",\"studyFirstSubmitQcDate\":\"2025-01-23\",\"studyFirstPostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2025-01-29\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"lastUpdateSubmitDate\":\"2025-12-18\",\"lastUpdatePostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2025-12-22\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"sponsorCollaboratorsModule\":{\"responsibleParty\":{\"type\":\"SPONSOR\"},\"leadSponsor\":{\"name\":\"Haisco Pharmaceutical Group Co., Ltd.\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"}},\"oversightModule\":{\"oversightHasDmc\":false,\"isFdaRegulatedDrug\":false,\"isFdaRegulatedDevice\":false},\"descriptionModule\":{\"briefSummary\":\"The purpose of this study is to evaluate the efficacy and safety of HSK39297 tablets compared to eculizumab in Patients with PNH who Are Naive to Complement Inhibitor Therapy.\"},\"conditionsModule\":{\"conditions\":[\"PNH\"]},\"designModule\":{\"studyType\":\"INTERVENTIONAL\",\"phases\":[\"PHASE3\"],\"designInfo\":{\"allocation\":\"RANDOMIZED\",\"interventionModel\":\"PARALLEL\",\"primaryPurpose\":\"TREATMENT\",\"maskingInfo\":{\"masking\":\"NONE\"}},\"enrollmentInfo\":{\"count\":73,\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"armsInterventionsModule\":{\"armGroups\":[{\"label\":\"HSK39297 tablets\",\"type\":\"EXPERIMENTAL\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Drug: HSK39297 tablets\"]},{\"label\":\"Eculizumab Injection\",\"type\":\"ACTIVE_COMPARATOR\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Drug: Eculizumab Injection\"]}],\"interventions\":[{\"type\":\"DRUG\",\"name\":\"HSK39297 tablets\",\"description\":\"200mg QD for 24 weeks\",\"armGroupLabels\":[\"HSK39297 tablets\"]},{\"type\":\"DRUG\",\"name\":\"Eculizumab Injection\",\"description\":\"Eculizumab Injection for 24 weeks\",\"armGroupLabels\":[\"Eculizumab Injection\"]}]},\"outcomesModule\":{\"primaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"Proportion of participants achieving hemoglobin levels ≥ 12 g/dL at least on three out of four measurements in the absence of red blood cell transfusions\",\"timeFrame\":\"Between Week 18 and Week 24\"}],\"secondaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"Proportion of participants with increase in hemoglobin levels from baseline of ≥20 g/L at least on three out of four measurements in the absence of red blood cell transfusions\",\"timeFrame\":\"Between Week 18 and Week 24\"},{\"measure\":\"Proportion of participants who did not receive blood transfusion.\",\"timeFrame\":\"Between Week 2 and Week 24\"},{\"measure\":\"Change from baseline in hemoglobin\",\"timeFrame\":\"Baseline, week 18 to 24\"},{\"measure\":\"Change From Baseline in Reticulocyte Count\",\"timeFrame\":\"Baseline, week 18 to 24\"},{\"measure\":\"Percent change from baseline in LDH\",\"timeFrame\":\"Baseline, week 18 to 24\"},{\"measure\":\"Change from baseline in FACIT-Fatigue score\",\"timeFrame\":\"Baseline, week 18 to 24\"},{\"measure\":\"Rate of breakthrough hemolysis (BTH)\",\"timeFrame\":\"24 weeks\"},{\"measure\":\"Proportion of participants with Major Adverse Vascular Events (MAVEs)\",\"timeFrame\":\"24 weeks\"}]},\"eligibilityModule\":{\"eligibilityCriteria\":\"Inclusion Criteria:\\n\\n1. Age ≥ 18 and ≤ 75 years, Male and female patients;\\n2. Diagnosis of PNH based on flow cytometry with clone size \\\\> 10% by granulocytes;\\n3. Have not received complement inhibitor treatment;\\n4. Blood LDH values \\\\> 1.5 ×upper limit of the normal range (ULN) ;\\n5. Hemoglobin level \\\\< 10 g/dL at screening.\\n\\nExclusion Criteria:\\n\\n1. Hereditary or acquired complement deficiency;\\n2. Active primary or secondary immunodeficiency;\\n3. History of splenectomy, bone marrow/ hematopoietic stem cell or solid organ transplants;\\n4. History of recurrent invasive infections caused by encapsulated organisms( e.g. meningococcus or pneumococcus) or Mycobacterium tuberculosis;\\n5. Patients with laboratory evidence of bone marrow failure (reticulocytes \\\\< 100x10\\\\^9/L, or platelets \\\\< 30x10\\\\^9/L or neutrophils \\\\< 0.5x10\\\\^9/L) ;\\n6. Active systemic infection within 2 weeks prior to study drug administration;\\n7. History of serious comorbidities that have been determined to be unsuitable for participation in the study.\\n8. Pregnant or Lactating women.\",\"healthyVolunteers\":false,\"sex\":\"ALL\",\"minimumAge\":\"18 Years\",\"maximumAge\":\"75 Years\",\"stdAges\":[\"ADULT\",\"OLDER_ADULT\"]},\"contactsLocationsModule\":{\"locations\":[{\"facility\":\"The First Affiliated Hospital of Nanjing Medical University\",\"city\":\"Nanjing\",\"state\":\"Jiangsu\",\"zip\":\"210029\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":32.06167,\"lon\":118.77778}},{\"facility\":\"The First Affiliated Hospital, College of Medicine, Zhejiang University\",\"city\":\"Hangzhou\",\"state\":\"Zhejiang\",\"zip\":\"310003\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":30.29365,\"lon\":120.16142}}]},\"ipdSharingStatementModule\":{\"ipdSharing\":\"UNDECIDED\"}},\"derivedSection\":{\"miscInfoModule\":{\"versionHolder\":\"2026-09-18\"},\"interventionBrowseModule\":{\"meshes\":[{\"id\":\"C481642\",\"term\":\"eculizumab\"}]}},\"hasResults\":false}", "media_type": "application/json", "text_derivation": {"extractor_version": "stdlib-json-object-slice-v1", "method": "ctgov-study-json-v1", "raw_asset": {"byte_size": 666988, "media_type": "application/json", "relative_path": "evidence/raw/sha256/7c/7ce4995256632f1ce93e0e7444e375fecb7379ed09eb6dc461c4c809907a31f1.bin", "sha256": "7ce4995256632f1ce93e0e7444e375fecb7379ed09eb6dc461c4c809907a31f1"}, "record_selector": {"nct_id": "NCT06799546", "study_index": 0}, "schema_version": "1.0", "text_sha256": "77ace8b418e1a01ecded13a7ad29245480d01ce1e2b806f4135fdb9dfb0652db"}}